od to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned."},"number":"HR 10076","policyArea":"International Affairs","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Imposes sanctions on Russian Federation government officials, entities, and persons supporting Russia's defense industrial base or undermining Ukraine's military readiness. Includes prohibitions on financial transactions, energy investments, securities trading, uranium imports, and tariffs on Russian goods. Extends Iran sanctions authority.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Lindsey O. Graham Sanctioning Russia and Iran Act of 2026","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/10076"},{"bipartisan":true,"cosponsors":3,"crossPartyCosponsors":2,"id":"hr9631-119","introducedDate":"2026-07-09","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-07-09","text":"Referred to the Committee on Natural Resources, and in addition to the Committees on Foreign Affairs, and Ways and Means, for a period to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned."},"number":"HR 9631","policyArea":"Animals","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Prohibits the importation, exportation, and interstate trade of bear viscera and bear viscera products. Establishes criminal and civil penalties for violations and directs the Secretary of the Interior to conduct international discussions on bear conservation and enforce the prohibition.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Bear Poaching Elimination Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/9631"},{"bipartisan":true,"cosponsors":2,"crossPartyCosponsors":1,"id":"hr9632-119","introducedDate":"2026-07-09","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-07-09","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Energy and Commerce."},"number":"HR 9632","policyArea":"Health","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Establishes a federal Coordinator of AI Innovation to improve pediatric cancer diagnoses, treatments, and prevention through artificial intelligence integration with the Childhood Cancer Data Initiative, including enhanced clinical trials, data sharing, and interoperability standards.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Accelerating Innovation (AI) for Kids with Cancer Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/9632"},{"bipartisan":true,"cosponsors":10,"crossPartyCosponsors":4,"id":"hr8697-119","introducedDate":"2026-05-07","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-05-07","text":"Referred to the Committee on Armed Services, and in addition to the Committees on Transportation and Infrastructure, and the Judiciary, for a period to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned."},"number":"HR 8697","policyArea":"Armed Forces and National Security","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Amends the Homeland Security Act of 2002 and federal law to authorize the National Guard, at a state governor's request, to protect certain facilities and assets from unmanned aircraft under specified conditions and legal exemptions.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Guard the Skies Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/8697"},{"bipartisan":false,"cosponsors":2,"crossPartyCosponsors":1,"id":"hr8284-119","introducedDate":"2026-04-15","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-04-22","text":"Ordered to be Reported (Amended) by the Yeas and Nays: 43 - 1."},"number":"HR 8284","policyArea":"Foreign Trade and International Finance","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Bureau of Industry and Security License Administration Enhancement Act This bill revises certain processes used by the Department of Commerce's Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) to review applications for export licenses. Specifically, the bill requires BIS to administer any export control license or other authorization considered pursuant to an is informed letter or similar guidance or...","summarySource":"crs","title":"Bureau of Industry and Security License Administration Enhancement Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/8284"},{"bipartisan":true,"cosponsors":3,"crossPartyCosponsors":1,"id":"hr8253-119","introducedDate":"2026-04-13","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-04-14","text":"Referred to the Subcommittee on Border Security and Enforcement."},"number":"HR 8253","policyArea":"Immigration","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Establishes the Biometric Identification Transnational Migration Alert Program (BITMAP) within the Department of Homeland Security to coordinate with foreign governments and federal agencies in collecting and sharing biometric data to identify security and terrorism threats before they reach the U.S. border. The program terminates after six years.","summarySource":"ai","title":"BITMAP Authorization Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/8253"},{"bipartisan":true,"cosponsors":9,"crossPartyCosponsors":7,"id":"hr7506-119","introducedDate":"2026-02-11","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2026-02-11","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Foreign Affairs."},"number":"HR 7506","policyArea":"Foreign Trade and International Finance","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Imposes sanctions on foreign persons purchasing or facilitating trade in Russian crude oil and petroleum products, effective 90 days after enactment. Permits limited exceptions for countries isolating Russian funds, supporting Ukraine, or reducing purchases significantly, with a 5-year sunset provision.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Decreasing Russian Oil Profits Act of 2026","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/7506"},{"bipartisan":true,"c